{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"files\":[{\"content\":\"#include <bits/stdc++.h>\\n\\nusing namespace std;\\n\\nint A[1000][1000];\\nint ps[1010][1010];\\n\\ntypedef long long ll;\\n\\nll count_column_start(int j, int m, int n, int k) {\\n  ll subtotal = 0;\\n  for (int l = j; l <= n; l++) {\\n    unordered_map<ll, ll> h;\\n    h[0] = 1;\\n    ll s = 0;\\n    for (int i = 1; i <= m; i++) {\\n      s += ps[i][l] - ps[i][j - 1];\\n      auto it = h.find(s - k);\\n      if (it != h.end()) subtotal += it->second;\\n      h[s]++;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  return subtotal;\\n}\\n\\nll solve(int m, int n, int k) {\\n  for (int i = 1; i <= m; i++) {\\n    for (int j = 1; j <= n; j++) {\\n      ps[i][j] = A[i - 1][j - 1] + ps[i][j - 1];\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  ll ans = 0;\\n  const ll estimated_work = 1LL * m * n * (n + 1) / 2;\\n  if (estimated_work >= 200000) {\\n#pragma omp parallel for schedule(static, 1) reduction(+ : ans)\\n    for (int j = 1; j <= n; j++) {\\n      ans += count_column_start(j, m, n, k);\\n    }\\n  } else {\\n    for (int j = 1; j <= n; j++) {\\n      ans += count_column_start(j, m, n, k);\\n    }\\n  }\\n  return ans;\\n}\\n\\nint main() {\\n  int k, m, n;\\n  cin >> k >> m >> n;\\n  memset(A, 0, sizeof A);\\n  memset(ps, 0, sizeof ps);\\n\\n  for (int i = 0; i < m; i++)\\n    for (int j = 0; j < n; j++)\\n      cin >> A[i][j];\\n\\n  cout << solve(m, n, k) << endl;\\n  return 0;\\n}\\n\",\"path\":\"src/main.cpp\"}],\"hypothesis\":\"Cyclic static assignment of column-start groups should balance their decreasing workloads with less scheduling overhead than dynamic work sharing, while a reduction combines per-thread counts and a work cutoff keeps small cases serial.\",\"notes\":\"No documentation research requested. The controller should measure correctness and performance.\",\"research\":{\"queries\":[],\"urls\":[]},\"sources_kept\":[],\"transformations\":[\"Extract column-start counting into an independent helper, then parallelize the outer loop with OpenMP schedule(static, 1) and a reduction when estimated work reaches 200000 operations; keep smaller inputs serial.\"]}"}}
